{"id":133,"name":"NALCN — Na⁺-leak канал (non-selective)","category":"Leak","description":"Na+ leak channel. Voltage-independent, non-selective cation (P_Na:P_K:P_Ca≈1.3:1.3:0.5). Sets resting Na+ permeability and resting potential with K2P.","params":{"P_max":0.05},"bio_ref":"NALCN — sodium leak channel, non-selective (Lu et al. 2007; Ren 2011)","bio_role":"Покоящаяся Na⁺-проводимость. Уравновешивает Na⁺/K⁺-АТФазу, держит Na_i≈10-15мМ и потенциал покоя."}
